WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:03.903
♪♪

00:00:03.936 --> 00:00:05.805 line:0%
MAN:<i> Listen carefully.</i>

00:00:05.838 --> 00:00:06.906 line:0%
What do I do?

00:00:06.939 --> 00:00:08.441 line:0%
MAN:<i> Aliens have taken
 over this spaceship.</i>

00:00:08.474 --> 00:00:10.243 line:0%
[laughs]

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:11.244 line:0%
Okay.

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:13.146 line:0%
<i> You have made it
 to the mothership in time.</i>

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:14.514 line:0%
I did do that.

00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:17.950 line:0%
<i> If those eggs hatch,
 mankind will end.</i>

00:00:17.983 --> 00:00:19.919 line:0%
Oh...
[laughs]

00:00:19.952 --> 00:00:21.721 line:0%
That's a lot of pressure
on a guy.

00:00:21.754 --> 00:00:23.589 line:0%
<i> Your mission is
 to initiate</i>

00:00:23.622 --> 00:00:26.292 line:0%
<i> the self-destruct
 program on the ship.</i>

00:00:26.325 --> 00:00:27.827 line:0%
Self-destruct.

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:29.729 line:0%
<i> You will not be
 working alone.</i>

00:00:29.762 --> 00:00:31.064 line:0%
[doors opening]

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:38.204
♪♪

